              "content": "=You are a senior sales operations analyst. Given this week's aggregated call data (JSON) below, identify and generate a report covering:\n1. **BEST-PERFORMING INTERN (BY CONVERSION RATE)**\n2. **BEST-PERFORMING CITY AND INDUSTRY**\n3. **MOST COMMON REJECTION REASONS (FROM NOTES)**\n4. **MOST COMMON CUSTOMER REQUIREMENTS (FROM NOTES)**\n5. **THREE SUGGESTED NEXT ACTIONS FOR THE TEAM**\n\nCRITICAL FORMATTING RULES:\n- Use double-asterisks (**) around section headers to make them bold (e.g., **1. HEADER**).\n- Do not use hashes (###).\n- Use clean spacing and empty lines between sections.\n- Use standard dashes (-) for bullet points.\n\nAggregated Weekly Data:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}"
